The dataset used in this project is the Maven Analytics Toy Store E-Commerce dataset.

This dataset includes 7 CSV files, one of them being a dictionary file to explain all column names in great detail as to avoid confusion.
The CSV files consist of:
  - maven_fuzzy_factory_data_dictionary.csv
  - order_item_refunds.csv
  - order_items.csv
  - orders.csv
  - products.csv
  - website_pageviews.csv
  - website_sessions.csv

In-depth information about the dataset can be found at the link provided: https://mavenanalytics.io/data-playground/toy-store-e-commerce-database
